🌊 AI SpillGuard - Oil Spill Detection System
An AI-powered deep learning model for detecting and segmenting oil spills in satellite imagery using EfficientNetB0-UNet architecture.

Features
🎯 Real-time oil spill detection in satellite images

📊 Pixel-level segmentation masks

🔴 Red overlay visualization of spills

📈 Automatic risk level classification (Clean/Minimal/Warning/Critical)

💾 SQLite database for detection history

📥 Download segmentation masks and reports as CSV

🌐 Web interface built with Streamlit

📊 Interactive analytics dashboard

Model Architecture
EfficientNetB0-UNet with:

Input: 256×256×3 RGB images

Output: 256×256×1 binary segmentation mask

Total Parameters: 4.2M

Loss: Binary Crossentropy

Metrics: Dice Coefficient, IoU Score

Dataset
Training: 811 images

Validation: 203 images

Testing: 254 images

Total: 1,268 satellite images with manual annotations

