Risk Levels
✅ Clean (< 1%): No oil spill detected

ℹ️ Minimal (1-5%): Small spill - Monitor area

⚠️ Warning (5-15%): Moderate spill detected

🚨 Critical (> 15%): Severe spill - Immediate action needed

Training
